## 🎯 Goal Setting

Define and track your goals with your mentor, updating them in your **agenda repository**.

**✅ Steps**
- [ ] Develop your **personal agenda** with key tasks and learning objectives
- [ ] Set **mid-term** goals (per semester), and work on them in weekly iterations
- [ ] Align with team priorities and update goals regularly
- [ ] Explore internal and external **learning opportunities** (workshops, conferences, online courses)

We use **OKRs** (Objectives & Key Results) to make plans and track progress. Example:
> - **Objective**: Strengthen research skills  
>   - **Key Result 1**: Complete a literature review  
>   - **Key Result 2**: Present findings to the team  
>   - **Key Result 3**: Submit a research summary  

**🗓 Regular Check-ins**
- **Weekly/Biweekly**: 1:1 mentor meeting  
- **Semester**: Goal review & adjustments  

**Take ownership, ask for support, and grow with the team! 🚀**

